  "limitations": [
    "One disposable IPv4 workload vNIC per Windows version; no IPv6 or full pod churn qualification.",
    "One endpoint is queued per5-second tick; convergence grows with active endpoints and command execution time.",
    "Periodic repair does not guarantee immediate MTU enforcement after an external adapter change.",
    "UDP fragmentation reliability, fresh CAPI worker boots, preloading, replacement and gateway failover remain gates."
